{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1016934-2e-everything-on-soul-stones","id":1016934,"title":"[2E] Everything on Soul Stones","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-14T00:52:02-08:00","id":1016934,"title":"[2E] Everything on Soul Stones","content":"Topic for questions on Soul Stones in 2E. My first package:<br /> <br /> 1. In 1E characters could use Soul Stones to cast spells without Paradox, outside of Demense. Could it be recreated with them in 2E?<br /> 2. 2E rules mention Soul Stones work as Dedicated Tool - to use them in this way you need them to literally wave your Stone in front of you? Or would suffice having near you, like in purse?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T01:50:08-08:00","id":1016950,"title":"","content":"1. You'd have to house rule it because souls stones only reduce Paradox now instead of getting rid of it completely by letting a soul stone be used as a dedicated tool.<br /> 2. Yes, obviously, you have to -use- the Yantra if you want the benefit of the Yantra. Keeping it stashed in your purse would be useless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T08:24:36-08:00","id":1017082,"title":"","content":"1. Updating the rules wouldn't be difficult at all. To be honest, from what I recall, I don't even imagine them needing changing.<br /> <br /> 2. Yantras need to be focal to the spell somehow, but you don't need to wave it about. It could be set at the centre of a magic circle or worn in a crown or set in an empty eye socket or placed atop a staff, etc. Whatever suits the Imago.<br /> <br /> I'm curious if anyone has tried designing environmental tilts for demesnes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T09:09:51-08:00","id":1017101,"title":"","content":"If your spell is all about hidden advantages and deception, I can see a yantra being in your purse working, exactly because it's in your purse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-14T09:53:24-08:00","id":1017117,"title":"","content":"While I appreciate the idea, I cannot help but giggle at the mental image of a black-clad Guardian assassin carrying a bright red Prada bag.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.